{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":32302,\"title\":\"3 Ninjas: High Noon at Mega Mountain\",\"tagline\":\"Saving the day the ninja way!\",\"overview\":\"Three young boys, Rocky, Colt and Tum Tum together with their neighbor girl, computer whiz Amanda are visiting Mega Mountain amusement park when it is invaded by an army of ninjas led by evil Medusa, who wants to take over the park and hold the owners for ransom. Kids and retired TV star Dave Dragon, who made his farewell appearance at the park at the time the ninjas appeared, have to break Medusa's vicious plans.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7jKefCfhcXLd1qVnmc1zBhSgPjh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q7soebyjssEwNulE3SsWX96UfSb.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"voteCount\":226,\"year\":1998,\"runtime\":93,\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":375805,\"director\":\"Sean McNamara\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":129952,\"name\":\"Sean McNamara\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iJLRIBB2P3LXsPBvzdYhf06Lful.jpg\"},{\"id\":11395,\"name\":\"Victor Wong\",\"character\":\"Grandpa Mori\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3XvU2mK3i5V8Un7HyZn5pVnp4qw.jpg\"},{\"id\":166701,\"name\":\"Mathew Botuchis\",\"character\":\"Rocky\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2TdtJvfGFE7XhGMD1gBEhUZyrTs.jpg\"},{\"id\":16620,\"name\":\"Hulk Hogan\",\"character\":\"Dave Dragon\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i27iSeP7hhtlFOeVnthRQ9Ox2m4.jpg\"},{\"id\":34735,\"name\":\"Loni Anderson\",\"character\":\"Medusa\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vxygylfk2IVBUoXRyKAPNwPWPsf.jpg\"},{\"id\":12899,\"name\":\"Jim Varney\",\"character\":\"Lothar Zogg\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zvBFmvKUrPvE6FW35O3RP4i1ZPp.jpg\"},{\"id\":113713,\"name\":\"Michael O'Laskey II\",\"character\":\"Co