tps://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jvpkBenB6hv19WWYVlaiow8zklq.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The now-reformed Bad Guys are trying (very, very hard) to be good, but instead find themselves hijacked into a high-stakes, globe-trotting heist, masterminded by a new team of criminals they never saw coming: The Bad Girls.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":417859,\"title\":\"Puss in Boots\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7a5Jzjr9TmffGy76y1SZhn3sCiz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c5MCkebYhFuhmi32x760HfcvLIO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Long before he even met Shrek, the notorious fighter, lover and outlaw Puss in Boots becomes a hero when he sets off on an adventure with the tough and street smart Kitty Softpaws and the mastermind Humpty Dumpty to save his town. This is the true story of The Cat, The Myth, The Legend... The Boots.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":38055,\"title\":\"Megamind\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uZ9ytt3sPTx62XTfN56ILSuYWRe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/irpJXGiVr539uuspcQcNdkhS2lq.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After Megamind, a highly intelligent alien supervillain, defeats his long-time nemesis Metro Man, Megamind creates a new hero to fight, but must act to save the city when his \\\"creation\\\" becomes an even worse villain than he was.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":893723,\"title\":\"PAW Patrol: The Mighty Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aTvePCU7exLepwg5hWySjwxojQK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zgQQF04u3OgNBJqClRNby1FPz9s.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A magical meteor crash lands in Adventure City and gives the PAW Patrol pups superpowers, transforming them into The Mighty Pups.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5175,\"title\":\"Rush Hour 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aBQf2vMiCINeVC9v6BGVYKXurTh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vPJwn9pp5f58CqdaXU3eOSLoJkl.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It's vacation time for Carter as he finds himself alongside Lee in Hong Kong wishing for more excitement. While Carter wants to party and meet the ladies, Lee is out to track down a Triad gang lord who may be responsible for killing two men at the American Embassy. Things get complicated as the pair stumble onto a counterfeiting plot. The boys are soon up to their necks in fist fights and life-threatening situations. A trip back to the U.S. may provide the answers about the bombing, the counterfeiting, and the true allegiance of sexy customs agent Isabella.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5375,\"title\":\"Fred Claus\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9gATbvoRMxVeoHInwS8nR0KZMVc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nf9Y9KtrSFqUz3gNbsrgmFJV1S4.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fred Claus and Santa Claus have been estranged brothers for many years. Now Fred must reconcile his differences with his brother whom he believes overshadows him. When an efficiency expert assesses the workings at the North Pole and threatens to shut Santa down, Fred must help his brother to save Christmas.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"X39qLaob8XM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"isr7ENiGkao\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ETDGvqZ4nBI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":20